  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>📊👀 I’ve <strong>gone mad with trackers</strong> for the different flavors of football as each season starts — check them out to see a consensus of market odds, forecasts, ratings and various other stats I keep track of daily: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">📈2026 NFL Odds Tracker and Elo Ratings🏈</a></strong> - <em>By popular request, this is up now!</em> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">🎓2026 College Football Odds Tracker and QB Rankings🏈</a> </strong><em>- I’m <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2024-college-football-quarterback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bringing back the QB ratings</a> I used to use in my wildly unpopular <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/qb-u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“QB U” columns</a>, lol.</em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">⚽ 2026-27 English Premier League Tracker 📈</a></strong> <em>- Soccer also exists!</em></p></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/deshaun-watson-is-a-complete-and\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deshaun Watson Is a Complete and Total Failure That the Browns Won’t Quit</a></strong> - Five years, $230 million and zero worthwhile football later, Cleveland named Deshaun Watson their Week 1 starter over Shedeur Sanders — proving the Browns remain committed to doubling down on the worst decision in franchise history.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/trout-cabrera-was-simple-compared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Trout-Cabrera Was Simple Compared With PCA-Ohtani</a></strong> - The legendary 2012 AL MVP debate between Miguel Cabrera and Mike Trout was about traditional stats versus WAR. The modern sequel between Shohei Ohtani and Pete Crow-Armstrong is even more complex, framing the MVP conversation around everything WAR can’t capture.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/angel-reese-is-still-a-rebounding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Angel Reese Is Still a Rebounding Machine — But She’s Becoming Something More</a></strong> - Angel Reese shattered the WNBA’s single-game (26 boards!) and single-season rebounding records with the Atlanta Dream, but the bigger story is how her overall play is increasingly driving winning basketball.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-greatest-rotation-that-never\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Greatest Rotation That Never Was</a></strong> - A look back to 25 years ago, when the Florida Marlins assembled the “Young Guns” rotation — featuring Josh Beckett, A.J. Burnett, Ryan Dempster, Brad Penny and Matt Clement — a quintet that went on to win 642 games and five World Series rings, but only actually completed two full, 1-5 trips through the rotation order together in Miami.</p></li>\n<li><p>⛳ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/every-sport-suddenly-wants-another\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Every Sport Suddenly Wants Another Champion</a></strong> - This week, the PGA Tour became the latest league to announce a standalone side-quest trophy with its 2028 format overhaul. Obviously, this trend to create separate competitions is mainly driven by money — but in a modern sports environment poisoned by “Ring Culture”, they may also serve to help move us away from a toxic all-or-nothing mentality that values championships over the sport itself. </p></li>\n<li>\n<p><span>🏁 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/08/27/after-a-summer-of-calm-daytona-is-about-to-end-the-regular-season-in-chaos/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">After a summer of calm, Daytona is about to end the regular season in chaos</a></strong><span> - </span>At , I explored how an unusually tame midsummer run — without typical late-race cautions or chaos — is setting up the Cup Series regular-season finale at Daytona for an burst of classic superspeedway mayhem.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!4z2n!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F553160d3-0f00-499f-9fcf-cbf561944def_1728x1402.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!4z2n!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F553160d3-0f00-499f-9fcf-cbf561944def_1728x1402.png\" width=\"986\" height=\"800\" data-size=\"large\" alt=\"Chart showing the length of green-flag finishes in all of the races during the 2026 season in the NASCAR Cup Series.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/3R4wWeyLjUB8MDAMm6T6MV?si=hEBGrXhzReCmoYFZJp1qrA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: A Storm’s Brewin’</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I talked yet <em>another </em>long green-flag finish, with Ryan Blaney driving a masterclass in New Hampshire — but how Daytona is about to end the “abnormally normal” vibes soon. And we’re here to make our betting and one-and-done picks in the process!</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were my favorite items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/213029288/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">best names at the Little League World Series</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/back-to-school-back-to-100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chris Sale’s old-man velo</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/XHGJS/2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/968d20ce-924e-4331-8dce-ad2c28a14e1b_1220x1902.png\" alt=\"Age is just a (radar-gun) number\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Age is just a (radar-gun) number</p></div>\n<p>🏈<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/pros-in-college-losers-in-first-place\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">trend of older and more transfer-heavy</a> CFB stars…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/AWvfF/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/98760b29-5e21-48cd-9dd7-6f92b0a8e984_1220x1192.png\" alt=\"National title-game QBs are getting older (and more well-traveled) all the time\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>National title-game QBs are getting older (and more well-traveled) all the time</p></div>\n<p><strong>🎾</strong><em><strong> On the Americans’ <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-great-american-wait\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. Open drought</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://frontporchsports.substack.com/p/the-11-things-im-most-looking-forward-db2?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1460693&amp;post_id=213095642&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The 11 things I’m most looking forward to during the 2026 college football season”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://thespade.substack.com/p/nfl-weather-data-is-lying-to-you?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1892935&amp;post_id=208761827&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“NFL Weather Data is Lying to You”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://cfbdepth.substack.com/p/the-3-most-impactful-injury-situations?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2703415&amp;post_id=212976121&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The 3 Most Impactful Injury Situations Entering the 2026 Season”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://betweenperiods.substack.com/p/has-fantasy-football-jumped-the-shark?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10334546&amp;post_id=212907194&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Has Fantasy Football Jumped the Shark?”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://fancystats.substack.com/p/nobody-can-predict-the-nfl-standings?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=7912922&amp;post_id=212156570&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Nobody can predict the NFL standings particularly well.”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://spreadsheetsandtailgates.substack.com/p/adopt-a-program-college-football?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=3545990&amp;post_id=209938285&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Adopt a Program: College football teams to bring more joy to your 2026 season”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/nfl-cte-brain-disease.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Study’s Alarming Finding: At Least 1 in 4 N.F.L. Players Gets Brain Disease”</span></a></strong><span> by John Branch </span><em><span>(</span></em><strong><span>Note:</span></strong><em><span> I </span><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/profile/788589-neil-paine/note/c-322249220\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>have my issues with some of this story’s framing around selection bias</span></a></strong><span>, as I do with all of these CTE studies.)</span></em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://uniwatch.substack.com/p/ranking-the-most-awesomely-bad-pro?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10041743&amp;post_id=212930348&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Ranking the Most Awesomely Bad Pro Bowl Uniforms”</a></strong> by </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://nicoleauerbach.substack.com/p/who-won-the-college-football-offseason?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1360821&amp;post_id=213028883&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Who won the college football offseason?”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/the-al-is-exposing-a-serious-postseason?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=212185819&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The AL Is Exposing a Serious Postseason Problem (&amp; it’s not the one you think)”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://baseballreplayjournal.substack.com/p/it-didnt-start-with-1994?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1265175&amp;post_id=213135557&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“It Didn’t Start With 1994: When America fell out of love with baseball - or did it?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://pauldwhite.substack.com/p/forgotten-treasures-deion-sanders?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1409578&amp;post_id=210536710&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Forgotten Treasures: Deion Sanders Action Figure”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> <em><span>(I’m pretty sure I had that one growing up, LOL)</span></em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://almostcooperstown.substack.com/p/francisco-lindor-is-the-modern-barry?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1216321&amp;post_id=212704307&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Francisco Lindor is the Modern Barry Larkin – Almost Exactly”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://lancebroz.substack.com/p/pirates-paul-skenes-mechanics-brewers-antonio-senzatela-sinker-usage-cubs-kevin-gausman-splitter-grip-fastball-usage-2026-mlb-projections-rankings?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1619391&amp;post_id=212792984&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Paul Skenes Will Be Fine. Brewers Tweaked Senzatela”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://ibwaa.substack.com/p/whats-behind-the-dodgers-super-payroll?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=96452&amp;post_id=212492394&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“What’s Behind the Dodgers’ Super Payroll?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://baseballprojection.substack.com/p/why-is-the-position-player-free-agent?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5914842&amp;post_id=212426918&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Why is the position player free agent market so thin?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://blogs.fangraphs.com/in-search-of-the-perfect-rainbow-curveball/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“In Search of the Perfect Rainbow Curveball”</a></strong> by Ben Clemens</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://www.mlb.com/news/2026-brewers-offense-what-is-working\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Understanding how the Brewers’ brand of baseball works, and whether it can last”</a></strong> by Mike Petriello</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=663zhZoSnZQ\" target=